### Abuse Detection & Rate Limiting Integration

#### [NEW] [AbuseDetectionJob.java](file:///e:/agent/src/main/java/com/medisense/audit/AbuseDetectionJob.java)
- `@Scheduled(fixedRate = 900000)` job querying `audit_log` for:
  - Same `user_id` with > 10 `QUERY_CLASSIFIED_PRESCRIPTIVE` events in 1h -> flags Redis key `abuse:flag:{user_id}` (TTL 24h) + logs CRITICAL audit event.
  - Same IP with > 50 `RATE_LIMIT_EXCEEDED` events in 1h -> flags Redis key `abuse:ip:{ip}` (TTL 1h) + logs CRITICAL audit event.

#### [MODIFY] [RateLimitFilter.java](file:///e:/agent/src/main/java/com/medisense/api/ratelimit/RateLimitFilter.java)
- Check Redis keys `abuse:flag:{user_id}` and `abuse:ip:{ip}`. If present, cut `capacity` allowance by 50%.

